WEBVTT

00:00:04.209 --> 00:00:04.775
Hi there!

00:00:04.775 --> 00:00:09.180
In this video, I'll show you how to
place extra orders on Group Order,

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:13.082
for another person or a whole
group, along with your own meal,

00:00:13.082 --> 00:00:14.945
all in one cart.

00:00:14.945 --> 00:00:19.927
First, choose your delivery location
and the day you want to order for.

00:00:19.927 --> 00:00:22.546
Below the delivery time,
you'll see the green

00:00:22.546 --> 00:00:24.932
Order for Someone Else or a Group button.

00:00:24.932 --> 00:00:28.233
You'll also find it at the top of My Cart.

00:00:28.233 --> 00:00:33.585
Click it, and type a name for the person
or group you're ordering for, like CEO.

00:00:33.585 --> 00:00:36.819
This is the name that will
appear on the food label for

00:00:36.819 --> 00:00:40.386
each item, so use the name
you want your team to see.

00:00:40.386 --> 00:00:43.124
Then click Continue.

00:00:43.124 --> 00:00:48.206
Your cart now has an Extra Orders
section, with a card for CEO.

00:00:48.206 --> 00:00:50.719
To add more names, click Change Guest,

00:00:50.719 --> 00:00:54.091
then Add New Guest or Group,
and type another name,

00:00:54.091 --> 00:00:55.686
like CRO.

00:00:55.814 --> 00:01:00.344
You can also use a group
name, like Intern Lunches.

00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:09.704
With a name selected, choose a meal
as usual and click Add to Cart.

00:01:09.704 --> 00:01:13.361
It goes on the card for
the name shown at the top.

00:01:13.361 --> 00:01:19.220
Use Change Guest any time to switch
names and add food for the next person.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:24.950
To add your own meal, click Back to
Ordering for Myself, and add your food.

00:01:26.241 --> 00:01:30.728
It shows up under My Order,
above your extra orders.

00:01:30.728 --> 00:01:36.010
Everything is in one cart: your own
order, plus a card for each name.

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:40.140
When it all looks right,
click Proceed to Checkout.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.971
On the checkout page, you can
review your own order and each

00:01:43.971 --> 00:01:47.519
extra order, with the name
that will go on the food label.

00:01:47.519 --> 00:01:51.554
Your order isn't placed
until you complete checkout.

00:01:51.554 --> 00:01:52.239
That's it!

00:01:52.239 --> 00:01:54.705
One cart, as many names as you need.

00:01:54.705 --> 00:01:57.554
Thanks, and happy ordering!
